! Silicon at 40 Ry, for an equation of state. At a fixed cutoff a larger
! cell holds more plane waves, so the energy also falls because the basis
! grows. This error is the Pulay stress: about 44 kbar at 12 Ry, 1.1 kbar at
! 40 Ry and 0.11 kbar at 60 Ry on this cell.
 &control
    calculation = 'scf'
    tstress = .true.
 /
 &system
    ibrav=2, celldm(1)=10.20, nat=2, ntyp=1,
    ecutwfc=40.0
 /
 &electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-10
 /
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Si  28.086  Si.pz-vbc.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS (alat)
 Si 0.00 0.00 0.00
 Si 0.25 0.25 0.25
K_POINTS (automatic)
 4 4 4 0 0 0
